ed) and those for frequency of use were adjusted for any use of the other class of NSAID.</p></fn><fn id="t2-fn3"><label>b</label><p>Trend tests used the category of intake as an ordinal variable (0&#x02013;3).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>